// คิววอลเลย์บอล ไฟล์เดียวจบ (มีหน้าเว็บอยู่ในไฟล์นี้แล้ว) ใช้ Node.js 18 ขึ้นไป
// รัน: node queue.js   ตั้งรหัสผู้ดูแลด้วยตัวแปร ADMIN_PASSWORD (ถ้าไม่ตั้ง ทุกคนเป็นผู้ดูแล)
const http = require('http');
const fs = require('fs');
const path = require('path');
const os = require('os');
const crypto = require('crypto');

const PORT = Number(process.env.PORT) || 3000;
const ADMIN_PASSWORD = process.env.ADMIN_PASSWORD || '';
const DATA_FILE = path.join(__dirname, 'data.json');
const PAGE_HTML = Buffer.from('', 'base64');
const MAX_BODY = 64 * 1024;
const MAX_DOCS = 5000;
const PATH_RE = /^[A-Za-z0-9_\-.~:@+]{1,200}(\/[A-Za-z0-9_\-.~:@+]{1,200})*$/;

let docs = {};
try { docs = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(DATA_FILE, 'utf8')); } catch (e) { docs = {}; }

let saveTimer = null;
function save() {
  clearTimeout(saveTimer);
  saveTimer = setTimeout(() => {
    const tmp = DATA_FILE + '.tmp';
    fs.writeFile(tmp, JSON.stringify(docs), (err) => { if (!err) fs.rename(tmp, DATA_FILE, () => {}); });
  }, 200);
}

/* ---- กล่องแจ้งปัญหา: เก็บแยกจากข้อมูลคิว คนทั่วไปส่งได้อย่างเดียว ผู้ดูแลเท่านั้นที่อ่าน/ลบได้ ---- */
const REPORTS_FILE = path.join(__dirname, 'reports.json');
let reports = [];
try { reports = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(REPORTS_FILE, 'utf8')); if (!Array.isArray(reports)) reports = []; } catch (e) { reports = []; }
function saveReports() {
  const tmp = REPORTS_FILE + '.tmp';
  fs.writeFile(tmp, JSON.stringify(reports), (err) => { if (!err) fs.rename(tmp, REPORTS_FILE, () => {}); });
}
const repHits = new Map();
function repLimited(ip) {
  const now = Date.now(), a = (repHits.get(ip) || []).filter((t) => now - t < 10 * 60 * 1000);
  if (a.length >= 5) { repHits.set(ip, a); return true; }
  a.push(now); repHits.set(ip, a); return false;
}
function readBody(req, res, cb) {
  let size = 0; const chunks = [];
  req.on('data', (c) => { size += c.length; if (size > 4000) { res.writeHead(413); res.end(); req.destroy(); return; } chunks.push(c); });
  req.on('end', () => { let b = null; try { b = JSON.parse(Buffer.concat(chunks).toString('utf8')); } catch (e) { b = null; } cb(b); });
}

const clients = new Set();
function broadcastOnline() {
  const msg = 'event: online\ndata: ' + clients.size + '\n\n';
  clients.forEach((res) => res.write(msg));
}
function broadcast() {
  const msg = 'data: ' + JSON.stringify(docs) + '\n\n';
  clients.forEach((res) => res.write(msg));
}

/* ---- รหัสผ่านผู้ดูแล ---- */
const sha = (v) => crypto.createHash('sha256').update(v).digest();
const ADMIN_HASH = sha(ADMIN_PASSWORD);
const fails = new Map();
function clientIp(req) {
  const xf = req.headers['x-forwarded-for'];
  return (typeof xf === 'string' && xf.split(',')[0].trim()) || req.socket.remoteAddress || '?';
}
function limited(ip) {
  const f = fails.get(ip);
  if (!f) return false;
  if (Date.now() >= f.until) { fails.delete(ip); return false; }
  return f.n >= 8;
}
function noteFail(ip) {
  const f = fails.get(ip) || { n: 0, until: 0 };
  f.n += 1; f.until = Date.now() + 10 * 60 * 1000;
  fails.set(ip, f);
}
// คืนค่า 'ok' | 'none' (ไม่ได้ส่งรหัส) | 'bad' | 'limited'
function adminState(req) {
  if (!ADMIN_PASSWORD) return 'ok';
  const raw = req.headers['x-admin-password'];
  if (typeof raw !== 'string' || !raw) return 'none';
  const ip = clientIp(req);
  if (limited(ip)) return 'limited';
  let pw;
  try { pw = decodeURIComponent(raw); } catch (e) { pw = ''; }
  if (crypto.timingSafeEqual(sha(pw), ADMIN_HASH)) { fails.delete(ip); return 'ok'; }
  noteFail(ip);
  return 'bad';
}

/* ---- ตรวจคำสั่งเขียนข้อมูล ---- */
function validPath(p) {
  return typeof p === 'string' && PATH_RE.test(p) && p.split('/').length % 2 === 0;
}
function isPlain(o) { return o && typeof o === 'object' && !Array.isArray(o); }
function validOps(ops) {
  if (!Array.isArray(ops) || ops.length < 1 || ops.length > 50) return false;
  return ops.every((o) => o && validPath(o.path) &&
    (o.op === 'delete' || ((o.op === 'set' || o.op === 'update') && isPlain(o.data))));
}
var BAD = 'ควย,เหี้ย,เฮี้ย,สัส,ไอ้สัส,ส้นตีน,เย็ด,เงี่ยน,ชาติหมา,ระยำ,อีดอก,ดอกทอง,กระหรี่,อีสัตว์,ไอ้สัตว์,ไอ้เหี้ย,ไอ้ควาย,อีควาย,fuck,shit,bitch,dick,cunt,asshole,nigg,pussy,whore,slut'.split(',');
function normTxt(s) { return String(s).toLowerCase().replace(/[\u0E48-\u0E4C]/g, '').replace(/[^a-z0-9\u0E00-\u0E7F]/g, '').replace(/(.)\1+/g, '$1'); }
function hasBad(s, extra) { var n = normTxt(s); return BAD.concat(extra || []).some(function (w) { w = normTxt(w); return w && n.indexOf(w) !== -1; }); }
const EXTRA_BAD = (process.env.BANNED_WORDS || '').split(',').map((x) => x.trim()).filter(Boolean);
function validEntry(d, id) {
  return d.id === id && typeof d.name === 'string' && d.name.length >= 1 && d.name.length <= 60 && !hasBad(d.name, EXTRA_BAD) &&
    Number.isInteger(d.size) && d.size >= 1 && d.size <= 12 &&
    Array.isArray(d.pos) && d.pos.length <= 12 && d.pos.every((p) => typeof p === 'string' && p.length <= 4) &&
    typeof d.t === 'number' && typeof d.r === 'number' &&
    (d.court === undefined || d.court === 'F' || d.court === 'M') &&
    (d.tok === undefined || (typeof d.tok === 'string' && d.tok.length >= 8 && d.tok.length <= 64)) &&
    (d.pref === undefined || (typeof d.pref === 'string' && d.pref.length <= 40)) &&
    d.th === undefined && d.late === undefined && d.fresh === undefined;
}
/* ---- ตรวจสิทธิ์ "จบเกม" ของคนทั่วไป: ต้องมีทีมชนะตามกติกาจริง (คำนวณทีมฝั่งเซิร์ฟเวอร์) ---- */
const POSN = ['OP', 'OH', 'MB', 'L'];
const DEF_ROSTER = { OP: 1, OH: 2, MB: 2, L: 1 };
const CENTER_SLOT = { SB: 'OP', SM: 'MB' };
const hasOwn = (o, k) => Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(o, k);
function normPos(v) { if (v === 'CB') v = 'SB'; else if (v === 'CM') v = 'SM'; return POSN.includes(v) || hasOwn(CENTER_SLOT, v) ? v : 'ANY'; }
function slotOf(p) { return hasOwn(CENTER_SLOT, p) ? CENTER_SLOT[p] : p; }
function cfgNow() {
  const d = docs['config/main'] || {};
  const n = (v, lo, hi, def) => { v = parseInt(v, 10); return isNaN(v) ? def : Math.max(lo, Math.min(hi, v)); };
  const roster = {};
  POSN.forEach((p) => { roster[p] = n(d.roster && d.roster[p], 0, 4, DEF_ROSTER[p]); });
  const sum = POSN.reduce((a, p) => a + roster[p], 0);
  if (sum < 2 || sum > 12) Object.assign(roster, DEF_ROSTER);
  return { roster, mode: d.mode === 'random' ? 'random' : 'order', target: n(d.target, 5, 50, 25), winBy2: d.winBy2 !== false, maxWins: n(d.maxWins, 1, 5, 2) };
}
function planTeams(list, roster, mode) {
  const cap = POSN.reduce((a, p) => a + roster[p], 0), teams = [];
  const posOf = (e) => { const a = []; for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(e.size, cap); i++) a.push(normPos(Array.isArray(e.pos) ? e.pos[i] : null)); return a; };
  const fits = (t, ps) => {
    if (t.filled + ps.length > cap) return false;
    const add = {};
    ps.forEach((p) => { if (p !== 'ANY') { const s = slotOf(p); add[s] = (add[s] || 0) + 1; } });
    for (const p in add) if ((t.used[p] || 0) + add[p] > roster[p]) return false;
    return true;
  };
  for (const e of list) {
    const ps = posOf(e); let t = null;
    if (ps.length < cap && !e.fresh) {
      let pt = null;
      if (e.pref) { pt = teams.find((x) => x.members[0].id === e.pref) || null; if (pt && !fits(pt, ps)) pt = null; }
      const open = teams.filter((x) => fits(x, ps));
      if (pt) t = pt;
      else if (open.length) t = mode === 'random' ? open[Math.min(open.length - 1, Math.floor((Number(e.r) || 0) * open.length))] : open[0];
    }
    if (!t) { t = { members: [], filled: 0, used: {} }; teams.push(t); }
    t.members.push(e); t.filled += ps.length;
    ps.forEach((p) => { if (p !== 'ANY') { const s = slotOf(p); t.used[s] = (t.used[s] || 0) + 1; } });
  }
  return { teams, cap };
}
const finishPerm = {};
// คืนค่ารายชื่อ id ที่ต้องออกจากคิว ถ้าจบเกมนี้ได้จริง ไม่งั้น null
function authorizeFinish(court, side) {
  const cfg = cfgNow();
  const list = Object.keys(docs).filter((k) => k.startsWith('entries/')).map((k) => docs[k])
    .filter((e) => e && (e.court === 'M' ? 'M' : 'F') === court)
    .sort((a, b) => (a.t - b.t) || (a.id < b.id ? -1 : a.id > b.id ? 1 : 0));
  const { teams, cap } = planTeams(list, cfg.roster, cfg.mode);
  const A = teams[0], B = teams[1], m = docs['match/' + court];
  if (!A || !B || A.filled < cap || B.filled < cap || !m) return null;
  if (m.a !== A.members[0].id || m.b !== B.members[0].id) return null;
  const sa = parseInt(m.sa, 10) || 0, sb = parseInt(m.sb, 10) || 0;
  const s = side === 'A' ? sa : sb, o = side === 'A' ? sb : sa;
  if (!(s >= cfg.target && (!cfg.winBy2 || s - o >= 2))) return null;
  const w = side === 'A' ? A : B, l = side === 'A' ? B : A;
  const prev = m.streakKey === w.members[0].id ? (parseInt(m.streak, 10) || 0) : 0;
  const out = prev + 1 >= cfg.maxWins;
  return (out ? l.members.concat(w.members) : l.members).map((e) => e.id);
}
/* ---- Late (ย้ายทีมไปต่อท้ายคิว) และโหวตลบทีมที่ไม่มา ---- */
const hitMaps = {};
function hit(name, ip, max) {
  const m = hitMaps[name] || (hitMaps[name] = new Map()), now = Date.now();
  const a = (m.get(ip) || []).filter((t) => now - t < 10 * 60 * 1000);
  if (a.length >= max) { m.set(ip, a); return true; }
  a.push(now); m.set(ip, a); return false;
}
// หาทีมจากคีย์ (id คนแรก) พร้อมตรวจว่าย้าย/ลบได้ไหม (ทีมที่กำลังแข่งและเริ่มเล่นแล้ว คนทั่วไปทำไม่ได้)
function findTeam(court, key, isAdmin) {
  const cfg = cfgNow();
  const list = Object.keys(docs).filter((k) => k.startsWith('entries/')).map((k) => docs[k])
    .filter((e) => e && (e.court === 'M' ? 'M' : 'F') === court)
    .sort((a, b) => (a.t - b.t) || (a.id < b.id ? -1 : a.id > b.id ? 1 : 0));
  const { teams, cap } = planTeams(list, cfg.roster, cfg.mode);
  const idx = teams.findIndex((t) => t.members[0].id === key);
  if (idx < 0) return null;
  if (!isAdmin && idx < 2 && teams[0].filled >= cap && teams[1] && teams[1].filled >= cap) {
    const m = docs['match/' + court];
    const same = m && m.a === teams[0].members[0].id && m.b === teams[1].members[0].id;
    if (same && ((parseInt(m.sa, 10) || 0) + (parseInt(m.sb, 10) || 0) > 0 || m.running === true || Number(m.elapsed) > 0)) return null;
  }
  return teams[idx];
}
function pruneVotes() {
  let changed = false;
  for (const k of Object.keys(docs)) {
    if (!k.startsWith('votes/')) continue;
    const v = docs[k], key = k.slice(6);
    if (!v || Date.now() > v.exp || !docs['entries/' + key]) { delete docs[k]; delete voteSets[key]; changed = true; }
  }
  return changed;
}
const voteSets = {};
Object.keys(docs).forEach((k) => { if (k.startsWith('votes/')) delete docs[k]; });
setInterval(() => { if (pruneVotes()) { save(); broadcast(); } }, 5 * 60 * 1000).unref();
function finishAllowed(o) {
  const parts = o.path.split('/');
  if (parts[0] !== 'entries' || parts.length !== 2 || !docs[o.path]) return false;
  const c = docs[o.path].court === 'M' ? 'M' : 'F', p = finishPerm[c];
  if (!p || Date.now() > p.exp || !p.ids.has(parts[1])) return false;
  if (o.op === 'delete') return true;
  return o.op === 'update' && isPlain(o.data) && Object.keys(o.data).every((k) => k === 't') && typeof o.data.t === 'number';
}
// คนทั่วไปทำได้แค่: ลงชื่อใหม่ (สร้างอย่างเดียว) และอัปเดตคะแนน/เวลา
function allowedForPublic(ops, ownerTok) {
  return ops.every((o) => {
    const parts = o.path.split('/');
    if (parts[0] === 'match' && parts.length === 2 && ['F', 'M', 'main'].includes(parts[1]) && (o.op === 'set' || o.op === 'update')) return true;
    if (parts[0] === 'entries' && parts.length === 2 && o.op === 'set' && !(o.path in docs)) return validEntry(o.data, parts[1]);
    if (finishAllowed(o)) return true;
    if (parts[0] === 'entries' && parts.length === 2 && o.op === 'delete' && ownerTok && docs[o.path] && typeof docs[o.path].th === 'string') {
      const a = sha(ownerTok), b = Buffer.from(docs[o.path].th, 'hex');
      return b.length === a.length && crypto.timingSafeEqual(a, b);
    }
    return false;
  });
}
// เก็บเฉพาะค่าแฮชของรหัสเจ้าของรายการ (th) ไม่เก็บรหัสจริงในข้อมูลที่ทุกคนเห็น
function hideTokens(ops) {
  for (const o of ops) {
    if (o.op === 'set' && o.path.startsWith('entries/') && o.data && typeof o.data.tok === 'string') {
      o.data.th = sha(o.data.tok).toString('hex');
      delete o.data.tok;
    }
  }
}
function applyOps(ops) {
  for (const o of ops) {
    if (o.op === 'delete') delete docs[o.path];
    else if (o.op === 'set') docs[o.path] = o.data;
    else docs[o.path] = Object.assign({}, docs[o.path] || {}, o.data);
  }
  return Object.keys(docs).length <= MAX_DOCS;
}

function json(res, code, obj) {
  res.writeHead(code, { 'Content-Type': 'application/json; charset=utf-8', 'Cache-Control': 'no-store' });
  res.end(JSON.stringify(obj));
}

const server = http.createServer((req, res) => {
  const url = (req.url || '/').split('?')[0];

  if (req.method === 'GET' && url === '/api/events') {
    res.writeHead(200, {
      'Content-Type': 'text/event-stream', 'Cache-Control': 'no-cache, no-transform',
      Connection: 'keep-alive', 'X-Accel-Buffering': 'no'
    });
    res.write('retry: 2000\n\ndata: ' + JSON.stringify(docs) + '\n\n');
    clients.add(res);
    broadcastOnline();
    const beat = setInterval(() => res.write(': ping\n\n'), 25000);
    req.on('close', () => { clearInterval(beat); clients.delete(res); broadcastOnline(); });
    return;
  }

  if (req.method === 'GET' && url === '/api/state') return json(res, 200, docs);
  if (req.method === 'GET' && url === '/api/info') return json(res, 200, { adminRequired: !!ADMIN_PASSWORD });

  if (req.method === 'POST' && url === '/api/admin-check') {
    const st = adminState(req);
    if (st === 'ok') { res.writeHead(204); return res.end(); }
    res.writeHead(st === 'limited' ? 429 : 401); return res.end();
  }

  if (req.method === 'POST' && url === '/api/write') {
    const st = adminState(req);
    if (st === 'limited') { res.writeHead(429); return res.end(); }
    let size = 0;
    const chunks = [];
    req.on('data', (c) => {
      size += c.length;
      if (size > MAX_BODY) { res.writeHead(413); res.end(); req.destroy(); return; }
      chunks.push(c);
    });
    req.on('end', () => {
      let body;
      try { body = JSON.parse(Buffer.concat(chunks).toString('utf8')); } catch (e) { body = null; }
      if (!body || !validOps(body.ops)) { res.writeHead(400); return res.end('bad request'); }
      let ownerTok = '';
      try { ownerTok = decodeURIComponent(String(req.headers['x-owner-token'] || '')).slice(0, 64); } catch (e) { ownerTok = ''; }
      if (st !== 'ok' && !allowedForPublic(body.ops, ownerTok)) { res.writeHead(401); return res.end('admin required'); }
      hideTokens(body.ops);
      if (!applyOps(body.ops)) { res.writeHead(400); return res.end('too many documents'); }
      save();
      broadcast();
      res.writeHead(204);
      res.end();
    });
    return;
  }

  if (req.method === 'POST' && url === '/api/report') {
    if (repLimited(clientIp(req))) { res.writeHead(429); return res.end(); }
    return readBody(req, res, (b) => {
      const text = b && typeof b.text === 'string' ? b.text.trim() : '';
      const contact = b && typeof b.contact === 'string' ? b.contact.trim() : '';
      if (!text || text.length > 500 || contact.length > 60) { res.writeHead(400); return res.end('bad request'); }
      reports.unshift({ id: Date.now().toString(36) + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 6), t: Date.now(), text, contact });
      if (reports.length > 200) reports.length = 200;
      saveReports();
      res.writeHead(204); res.end();
    });
  }
  if (req.method === 'POST' && url === '/api/finish-auth') {
    return readBody(req, res, (b) => {
      const c = b && b.court === 'M' ? 'M' : 'F', side = b && b.side === 'B' ? 'B' : 'A';
      const ids = authorizeFinish(c, side);
      if (!ids) { res.writeHead(403); return res.end('not finished'); }
      finishPerm[c] = { ids: new Set(ids), exp: Date.now() + 60 * 1000 };
      res.writeHead(204); res.end();
    });
  }
  if (req.method === 'POST' && url === '/api/late') {
    const st = adminState(req);
    if (st === 'limited') { res.writeHead(429); return res.end(); }
    if (st !== 'ok' && hit('late', clientIp(req), 12)) { res.writeHead(429); return res.end(); }
    return readBody(req, res, (b) => {
      const c = b && b.court === 'M' ? 'M' : 'F';
      const team = b && typeof b.key === 'string' ? findTeam(c, b.key, st === 'ok') : null;
      if (!team) { res.writeHead(403); return res.end('not allowed'); }
      const all = Object.keys(docs).filter((k) => k.startsWith('entries/')).map((k) => docs[k]);
      const base = Math.max(Date.now(), ...all.map((e) => Number(e.t) || 0) ) + 1;
      team.members.forEach((e, i) => {
        const d = Object.assign({}, docs['entries/' + e.id], { t: base + i, late: true, fresh: i === 0 });
        if (i === 0) delete d.pref; else d.pref = team.members[0].id;
        docs['entries/' + e.id] = d;
      });
      delete docs['votes/' + b.key]; delete voteSets[b.key];
      save(); broadcast();
      res.writeHead(204); res.end();
    });
  }
  if (req.method === 'POST' && url === '/api/vote-remove') {
    if (hit('vote', clientIp(req), 20)) { res.writeHead(429); return res.end(); }
    return readBody(req, res, (b) => {
      const c = b && b.court === 'M' ? 'M' : 'F';
      const voter = b && typeof b.voter === 'string' && b.voter.length >= 8 && b.voter.length <= 64 ? b.voter : '';
      const team = voter && typeof b.key === 'string' ? findTeam(c, b.key, false) : null;
      if (!team) { res.writeHead(403); return res.end('not allowed'); }
      pruneVotes();
      const key = b.key, set = voteSets[key] || (voteSets[key] = new Set());
      const dup = set.has(voter);
      set.add(voter);
      let removed = false;
      if (set.size >= 3) {
        team.members.forEach((e) => { delete docs['entries/' + e.id]; });
        delete docs['votes/' + key]; delete voteSets[key]; removed = true;
      } else {
        docs['votes/' + key] = { n: set.size, exp: Date.now() + 20 * 60 * 1000 };
      }
      save(); broadcast();
      json(res, 200, { n: set.size, removed, dup });
    });
  }
  if (url === '/api/reports' && (req.method === 'GET' || req.method === 'POST')) {
    const st = adminState(req);
    if (st === 'limited') { res.writeHead(429); return res.end(); }
    if (st !== 'ok') { res.writeHead(401); return res.end('admin required'); }
    if (req.method === 'GET') return json(res, 200, reports);
    return readBody(req, res, (b) => {
      if (!b || typeof b.id !== 'string') { res.writeHead(400); return res.end('bad request'); }
      reports = reports.filter((r) => r.id !== b.id);
      saveReports();
      res.writeHead(204); res.end();
    });
  }

  if (req.method === 'GET' && (url === '/' || url === '/index.html')) {
    res.writeHead(200, { 'Content-Type': 'text/html; charset=utf-8', 'Cache-Control': 'no-cache' });
    return res.end(PAGE_HTML);
  }

  res.writeHead(404);
  res.end('not found');
});

server.listen(PORT, '0.0.0.0', () => {
  console.log('เซิร์ฟเวอร์คิววอลเลย์บอลทำงานแล้ว');
  console.log('  เครื่องนี้:   http://localhost:' + PORT);
  Object.values(os.networkInterfaces()).flat().forEach((i) => {
    if (i && i.family === 'IPv4' && !i.internal) console.log('  เครื่องอื่นใน Wi-Fi เดียวกัน: http://' + i.address + ':' + PORT);
  });
  console.log(ADMIN_PASSWORD ? 'รหัสผู้ดูแล: ตั้งไว้แล้ว' : 'คำเตือน: ยังไม่ได้ตั้ง ADMIN_PASSWORD ทุกคนจึงตั้งค่าและลบคิวได้');
});

process.on('SIGINT', () => {
  try { fs.writeFileSync(DATA_FILE, JSON.stringify(docs)); } catch (e) {}
  process.exit(0);
});
